      "created_at": "2012-02-02T23:25:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is a difference, and yes, “you” does matter!  In this case, Atlantean Font of Power is playing the card, not “you”, so the card still comes into play even if you are inside a Telekinetic Cocoon or are in Turret Mode.</p>",
